{
  "fallback": [
    {
      "text": "* Error",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    }
  ],
  "kill": [
    {
      "text": "* Hee hee hee...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I hope you like your\n  choice.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweysassy"
    },
    {
      "text": "* After all, it's not\n  as if you can go\n  back and change fate.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweysassy"
    },
    {
      "text": "* In this world, it's kill\n  or be killed.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* That old hag thought\n  she could break the\n  rules.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweysassy"
    },
    {
      "text": "* She tried so hard\n  to save you humans.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynicesideum"
    },
    {
      "text": "* But when it came\n  down to it...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Hee hee...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    },
    {
      "text": "* SHE COULDN'T EVEN\n  SAVE HERSELF.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* WHAT AN IDIOT!!",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    }
  ],
  "killTwice": [
    {
      "text": "* Heheheheh.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweysassy"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You just can't\n  get enough, can you!?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweysassy"
    },
    {
      "text": "* ...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* How many more\n  times will you\n  kill her?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Ha ha ha ha ha...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You disgusting animal.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You didn't even\n  TRY to spare her.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    }
  ],
  "killMany": [
    {
      "text": "* Wow, you really\n  can't get enough.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You kind of remind\n  me of myself.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    }
  ],
  "killedAfterSpare": [
    {
      "text": "* Wow, you're utterly\n  repulsive.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You spared her life...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Then you decided that\n  just wasn't interesting\n  enough for you.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel"
    },
    {
      "text": "* So you murdered her\n  just to see what\n  would happen.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel2"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You killed her out\n  of boredom.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Truly disgusting...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    }
  ],
  "explainAfterKill": [
    {
      "text": "* Wow, you're utterly\n  repulsive.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You spared her life...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Then you decided that\n  just wasn't interesting\n  enough for you.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel"
