    {
      "text": "* So you murdered her\n  just to see what\n  would happen.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel2"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You killed her out\n  of boredom.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Hee hee...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You naive idiot.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Do you think you\n  are the only one\n  with that power?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* The power to reshape\n  the world...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Purely by your\n  own determination.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* The ability to\n  play God!",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* The ability to \"SAVE.\"",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I thought I was\n  the only one with\n  that power. But...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I can't SAVE anymore.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynicesideum"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Apparently YOUR\n  desires for this\n  world override MINE.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynicesideum"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Well well.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Enjoy that power\n  while you can.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I'll be watching.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    }
  ],
  "murder": [
    {
      "text": "* Hahaha...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You're not really human,\n  are you?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynicesideum"
    },
    {
      "text": "* No. You're empty inside.\n* Just like me.\n* In fact...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynicesideum"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You're \\[C], right?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyplain"
    },
    {
      "text": "* We're still inseparable,\n  after all these years...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Listen.\n* I have a plan to become\n  all powerful.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Even more powerful than\n  you and your stolen\n  soul.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweysassy"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Let's destroy everything\n  in this wretched world.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Everyone, everything in\n  these worthless\n  memories...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Let's turn 'em all\n  to dust.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    }
  ],
  "sparedWithKills": [
    {
      "text": "* Clever.\n* Verrrryyy clever.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweysassy"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You think you're really\n  smart, don't you?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweysassy"
