    {
      "text": "* You spared the life\n  of a single person.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Hee hee hee...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Froggit, Whimsun.\n* Vegetoid, Loox.\n* Migosp, Moldsmal.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Think about those names.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Do you think any of\n  those monsters have\n  families?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Do you think any of\n  them have friends?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Each one could have\n  been someone else's\n  Toriel.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Selfish brat.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel2"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Somebody is dead\n  because of you.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweytoriel2"
    }
  ],
