    {
      "text": "* Hee hee hee...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I bet you feel\n  really great.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweysassy"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You didn't kill\n  anybody this time.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweysassy"
    },
    {
      "text": "* But what will you\n  do if you meet a\n  relentless killer?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* You'll die and you'll\n  die and you'll\n  die.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Until you tire of\n  trying.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynicesideum"
    },
    {
      "text": "* What will you do\n  then?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweynice"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Will you kill\n  out of frustration?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Or will you give\n  up entirely on\n  this world...",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    },
    {
      "text": "* ... and let ME inherit\n  the power to control\n  it?",
      "portrait": "spr_floweyevil"
    },
    {
      "text": "* I am the prince of\n  this world's future.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Don't worry, my little\n  monarch, my plan\n  isn't regicide.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    },
    {
      "text": "* This is SO much\n  more interesting.",
      "portrait": "spr_floweygrin"
    }
  ],
